WEBVTT

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:11.580
War...

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:21.370
Yes. War never changes, no matter the era.

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:03.870
One battle, followed by another...

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:19.910
This is the fleet I was waiting for!

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:29.200
It is not just our own, Your Majesty.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:32.620
It is a combined fleet with the Eagle Union.

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:36.620
This is indeed an astounding view.

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:38.700
Quite promising, certainly.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:44.120
Yes, indeed. This is going
to be a decisive battle.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:54.160
You can count on us, the Knights of the Sea.
We are second to none.

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:56.540
We can't let our big sister down.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:04:02.120
Can we relax a little?
We could get hurt being so tense like this.

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:07.540
That's right, you're all my precious
little sisters. Don't push your luck.

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:08.950
--Okay.
--Gotcha.

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:19.120
I guess there's no way around this now.

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:22.620
Showdown!

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:51.660
What's wrong, Takao?

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:54.580
Are we truly prepared for this?

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:59.450
Such a major battle, without even
completing Project Orochi...

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:01.620
What is Akagi thinking?

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:06.660
We couldn't get back the black Mental Cube.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.290
Perhaps she's flustered.

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:22.910
I don't know what Akagi is scheming,

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:28.620
but don't worry, Zuikaku.
Your big sister will always protect you.

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:29.910
Yeah...

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:37.540
Yay! Finally a real battle!

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:40.750
They will witness Yukikaze's great power!

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:47.410
What's wrong? You've been
gloomy for a while now.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:50.450
It's nothing. I'm fine.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:57.830
Don't worry. I, Shigure,
am blessed by the goddess of fortune!

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:59.750
Same with me!

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:02.040
Yeah, yeah, I haven't forgotten.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:21.000
Ayanami is on the other side...

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:36.660
It's okay. I don't know what to do yet...

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:39.500
But at least I have no doubts.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:49.700
Enterprise.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.580
Are you concerned about something?

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:57.580
No, just feeling the wind.

00:06:57.580 --> 00:07:02.330
A decisive battle is ahead of us.
I must be sharp.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:05.750
Please refrain from acting too rashly.

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:09.200
I will put in my best effort.

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.000
Enterprise.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:16.200
Don't worry so much.

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:18.580
I'm fine. I have no doubts.

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:28.000
Look at that determination...

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:31.830
She really is Yorktown's little sister.

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:33.870
My little sister is awesome, too!

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:37.160
She's, like, really, really cute!

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:40.000
That's where you see the rivalry?

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:01.950
There's been something wrong
with my radar for a while now.

00:08:01.950 --> 00:08:04.000
I hope this isn't a bad omen...

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:13.000
"Battleship <i>Massachusetts</i> "

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:13.000
Not good... I have a really
bad feeling about this.

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:21.790
There, I've set it up for you.

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:25.080
It's all up to you now, Akagi.

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:37.870
Heavenly wind, stop the passage
within the clouds.

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:40.790
The heavenly maidens...

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.580
...must remain on Earth!

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:06.750
Are you okay?

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:14.370
What is this place...?

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:15.870
Big sis! There!

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:26.160
The Siren!

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:37.410
Akagi!

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:42.450
Welcome to my sea, Azur Lane.

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:44.080
I welcome you all.

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:59.120
Go forth, royal soldiers!

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:28.580
Elegance isn't just for show!

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:54.080
Ready for a big boom?

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.250
I'll do my best.

00:12:22.120 --> 00:12:24.160
Wow... You're awesome, Eldridge.

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:31.700
That's the last one!

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:46.910
"Battleship <i>Ise</i> "

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:46.910
Good moves... I will enjoy this.

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:50.620
"Battleship <i>Hyuuga</i> "

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:50.620
Let's wrap this up and go for a drink.

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:55.950
Sakura Empire battleships...!

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:48.660
Now... Let me savor this.

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:53.830
Fire!

00:13:57.370 --> 00:14:00.160
Advance, Sakura Empire warriors!

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:01.870
Heaven's will is on our side!

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.790
It's begun...

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:22.950
But dear sister Souryuu,
what is this place that we're in?

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:26.160
What did Akagi do?

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:28.700
I have no idea...

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:36.580
I see the main actor is here!

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:41.950
Grey Ghost!

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:54.910
Wait!

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:57.000
Stand back, 5th Carrier Division.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:00.450
But, Kaga! I want to fight the Grey Ghost!

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:05.330
This is my fight, to vindicate my honor.
There is no role to play for a fledgling like you.

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:34.660
Is that really something carriers do now?

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:53.120
Are you really in alliance with the Siren?

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:57.500
Did Akashi talk? She needs to be disciplined.

00:15:57.500 --> 00:16:02.750
You and Akagi are traitors! Not to us,
but to your Sakura Empire comrades!

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:05.330
You know nothing about my sister!

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:18.080
I can't let Kaga do all the work.

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:25.450
Here comes the nuisance.

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:31.410
I should do some housekeeping.

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:41.580
Your meal is served!

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:50.120
I have you.

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:08.160
Enterprise...!

00:17:33.200 --> 00:17:36.250
Look, the ocean is so pretty today.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:40.410
From the moment we were born,
the ocean was a place for war.

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:46.790
The roar of artillery, the smell of gunpowder.

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:52.830
The heat of a nearby flame,
the cold of the water.

00:17:57.290 --> 00:18:00.040
For me, the ocean is...

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:40.330
Rest in peace, grey phantom.

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:42.870
Your will shall inhabit the Black Box,

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:45.620
and become part of a greater force.

00:18:57.950 --> 00:18:59.250
What's going on?!

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:07.000
Enterprise...!

00:19:10.450 --> 00:19:12.870
So you've awakened.

00:19:12.870 --> 00:19:15.410
I guess it's you again.

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:18.500
In this world as well, you are the key...

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:22.120
...Enterprise.

00:19:28.620 --> 00:19:30.660
What did you...?

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:35.250
Kaga!

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:47.790
Akagi! Kaga!

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:49.700
Zuikaku!

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:52.200
What is that?!

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:54.870
Big sister, what did you do?

00:19:57.160 --> 00:19:58.580
Laffey!

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:00.870
Everyone...

00:20:12.120 --> 00:20:14.540
Who... are you?

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:22.830
You won't stand in my way.

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:35.040
This is the manifestation of my love.

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:39.290
My love surpasses time and
overwhelms even the gods

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:40.870
for Sakura Empire...

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:42.370
And for my dear sister...!

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:51.450
Are you afraid of the ocean?

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:58.540
I see now.

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:00.200
I finally understand.

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:03.080
I...

00:22:04.580 --> 00:22:07.410
I am afraid of the ocean...

00:22:07.870 --> 00:22:13.290
<i>The ripples seeing each other</i>

00:22:13.290 --> 00:22:19.040
<i>Are messages exchanged with you</i>

00:22:19.040 --> 00:22:25.040
<i>Connecting us across this blue ocean</i>

00:22:25.040 --> 00:22:30.660
<i>Guideposts of light</i>

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:36.330
<i>Have you met someone nice?</i>

00:22:36.330 --> 00:22:42.000
<i>Are your days filled with smiles?</i>

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:47.540
<i>Filling your melancholy eyes with light</i>

00:22:47.540 --> 00:22:52.620
<i>When the starshine wanes in them</i>

00:22:53.620 --> 00:22:58.500
<i>I'm close to you</i>

00:22:58.500 --> 00:23:04.620
<i>Always by your side</i>

00:23:04.620 --> 00:23:09.830
<i>you can't see the next day</i>

00:23:09.830 --> 00:23:16.120
<i>I am calling out to your heart</i>

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:21.040
<i>Please stay with me</i>

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:27.120
<i>Please don't give up</i>

00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:36.200
<i>Until the morning comes</i>
<i>when we can hold hands</i>

00:23:44.750 --> 00:23:47.950
I've finally found you, my dear sister Amagi.

00:23:54.620 --> 00:23:57.910
It's not over yet, Akagi.
